  "description": "A modern .NET 9 library for dynamic settings management with JSON-first approach and automatic UI generation capabilities for WinUI 3, WPF, and other XAML frameworks. Features include bidirectional JSON-C# conversion, automatic UI generation, icons support, and built-in validation.",
  "id": "DynamicSettingsLibrary",
  "isPrerelease": false,
